# Wave W17-P (Route 117): fae lamp — a ROSEFAE lantern post of the flower fields: a slim post carrying a slow green lamp globe at its head, the light the fields’ keepers swear burns a little greener when the ROSEFAE are near (design: lantern posts along the flower road, their green lamp heads drawn slow and alive). On day turf (fully opaque, ground baked in) — the fleet’s only lamp post: split from every marker post by the glowing green head, which marks nothing but the fields themselves.
